# Font and image binaries must never be line-ending normalised or re-encoded.
# Every bundled icon font in the first commit had been mojibake-corrupted (read
# as text, re-saved as UTF-8), which inflated each file ~1.8x and made every
# icon render as an empty box. apps/myhub/checks.py:check_icon_fonts_intact
# guards the working tree; these rules keep git out of the binaries entirely.
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.ttf    binary
*.otf    binary
*.eot    binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.webp   binary
*.pdf    binary
